# Dual Boot Journey

A long-overdue repo documenting my attempts to dual-boot Linux and Windows on my PC.

This is my **third attempt**. The first two (Omarchy, then Fedora) both worked, but each came with its own problems. I had screenshots and notes for both, but assignment submission week pushed documenting down my priority list. Then a complication with **Safeblock**, a forensic tool that blocks external drives and forces them into read-only mode, forced me to reset my PC, and I lost almost all of it. Only a few photos survive, either shared with a friend or uploaded online. What Safeblock did exactly is covered later in this repo.

